<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PLSemanticsBench</span>: Large Language Models as Programming Language Interpreters</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
