<span id="A1.T10.2.73.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">break at LE pops <math id="A1.T10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>χ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi</annotation></semantics></math> and terminates loop.</span>
</span></td></tr>
