The <span id="A2.F4.sf1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">C++</span> solution to the problem “MBCPP/962” in BabelCode MBPP and one public test case. The public test we use is <span id="A2.F4.sf1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">sumEven(3, 8)==18</span>.
</figcaption>
