<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SS3.p3.pic1.p1.1.198" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   &lt;j&gt;0&lt;/j&gt;</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.SS3.p3.pic1.p1.1.199" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   &lt;/program_state&gt;</span>
