<div id="A6.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.I1.i3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">URL: <a href="https://github.com/google-deepmind/code_contests" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/google-deepmind/code_contests</a></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A6.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Leetcode</p>
<ol id="A6.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A6.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="A6.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We scrape only the ground-truth solutions and public test cases
from leetcode. We use the collected problems for academic purposes only.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A6.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
