</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We construct the LLM-Translated dataset by using <span id="A6.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Qwen2.5-Instruct 32B</span> to translate the C++
solutions to problems from:</p>
<ol id="A6.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A6.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A6.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
