</div></li>
<li id="A6.I2.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A6.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">URL: <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/open-r1/codeforces" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://huggingface.co/datasets/open-r1/codeforces</a></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.2 </span>Models</h3>

<div id="A6.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate LLMs designed for coding tasks and enhanced reasoning
ability on our <span id="A6.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PLSemanticsBench</span>:</p>
<ol id="A6.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A6.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
