<section id="A6.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.3 </span>Icons</h3>

<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use several icons from <a href="https://www.flaticon.com" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com</a> which we
attribute here.</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="A6.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A6.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Document icons created by Roman Káčerek - <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/document" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/document</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Robot icons created by Kiranshastry - <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/robot" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/robot</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
