</div></li>
<li id="A6.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Diff icons created by brajaomar_j - <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/diff" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/diff</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I4.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I4.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I4.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Matrix icons created by meaicon - <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/matrix" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/matrix</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I4.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I4.i6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I4.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Logistic regression icons created by raidolicon - <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/logistic-regression" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/logistic-regression</a></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I4.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I4.i7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I4.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Game chart icons created by Arslan Haider - <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/game-chart" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/game-chart</a></p>
</div></li>
